+  "Skill_1006109_SkillDescribe": "Attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> equal to {0} of Hsin's ATK.\nHsin gains <color=Highlight>Nightglow</color> upon entering combat or casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Pillars Across Heaven</color>. When Hsin casts <color=Highlight>Outro Skill</color>, <color=Highlight>Nightglow</color> is consumed to trigger various effects depending on the <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode</color> She is in:\n- While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, Resonators in the team other than Hsin gain <color=Highlight>Shared Light</color> when they gain <color=Highlight><te href=131110>Unison</te></color>. After Hsin casts <color=Highlight>Outro Skill</color>, Resonators with <color=Highlight>Shared Light</color> gain {1} All DMG Amplification for {2}s.\n- While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, Electro DMG dealt by Resonators in the team other than Hsin is Amplified by {3} for {4}s.\nThe above effects end early when Hsin switches Resonance Mode.",
   "Skill_1006109_SkillName": "Herself a Thousand Lanterns",
   "Skill_1006109_SkillResume": "Deal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation Finisher</color> is cast, casting this skill triggers various effects depending on the <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode</color>:\n- While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, Resonators in the team other than Hsin gain All DMG Amplification when they have gained <color=Highlight>Unison</color>.\n- While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, Electro DMG dealt by Resonators in the team other than Hsin is Amplified.",
-  "Skill_1006201_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack</color></size>\nPerform up to 3 consecutive attacks, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color></size>\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color>, performing up to 4 consecutive attacks, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nHold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 1 and Stage 2</color> in succession.\nShortly after casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 2</color>, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 1 and Stage 2</color> in succession, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nShortly after casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 3</color>, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 4</color>.\nShortly after casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 1</color>, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 2</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Mid-air Attack</color></size>\nConsume STA to perform Plunging Attack, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Dodge Counter</color></size>\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a certain time after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight> Dodge Counter - Unfurled Canopy</color>.\n- Shortly after casting the skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack Stage 3</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Dodge Counter - Unfurled Canopy</color></size>\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a certain time after a successful <color=Highlight>Dodge</color> to attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- Shortly after casting the skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 3</color>.\n- Shortly after casting the skill, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 1</color>, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.",
+  "Skill_1006201_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack</color></size>\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to perform up to 3 consecutive attacks, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color></size>\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color>, performing up to 4 consecutive attacks, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nHold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 1 and Stage 2</color> in succession.\nShortly after casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 2</color>, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 1 and Stage 2</color> in succession, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nShortly after casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 3</color>, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 4</color>.\nShortly after casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 1</color>, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 2</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Mid-air Attack</color></size>\nConsume STA to perform Plunging Attack, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Dodge Counter</color></size>\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a certain time after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight> Dodge Counter - Unfurled Canopy</color>.\n- Shortly after casting the skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack Stage 3</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Dodge Counter - Unfurled Canopy</color></size>\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a certain time after a successful <color=Highlight>Dodge</color> to attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- Shortly after casting the skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 3</color>.\n- Shortly after casting the skill, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 1</color>, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.",
   "Skill_1006201_SkillName": "Furled Canopy",
   "Skill_1006201_SkillResume": "<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color></size>\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color>, performing up to 4 consecutive attacks, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder</color></size>\nShortly after casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 2</color>, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 1 and Stage 2</color> in succession, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Mid-air Attack</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Dodge Counter</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Unfurled Canopy</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Dodge Counter - Unfurled Canopy</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.",
-  "Skill_1006202_SkillDescribe": "Attack targets within range, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- Upon being attacked by an enemy target, cast <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> to become immune to this damage and stagnate nearby targets. This <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> is immune to interruption and triggers <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Crimson Gleam</color>.\n- Entering the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state resets the Cooldown of <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> state, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack Stage 2</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to chain into <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 3</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Crimson Gleam</color></size>\nAttack targets within range, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> state, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack Stage 3</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to chain into <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 4</color>.",
+  "Skill_1006202_SkillDescribe": "Attack targets within range, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- Within a certain period after opening the umbrella and dashing forward, when attacked by an enemy target, Suoming becomes immune to this damage and stagnates nearby targets. She then becomes immune to interruption and receives 100% less DMG for a certain period, and casts <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Crimson Gleam</color>.\n- Entering the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state resets the Cooldown of <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> state, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack Stage 2</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to chain into <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 3</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Crimson Gleam</color></size>\nAttack targets within range, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> state, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack Stage 3</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to chain into <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 4</color>.",
   "Skill_1006202_SkillName": "Furled Canopy: Rift Cleaver",
-  "Skill_1006202_SkillResume": "Deal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- Upon being attacked by an enemy target, cast <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> to become immune to this damage and stagnate nearby targets. This <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> is immune to interruption and triggers <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Crimson Gleam</color>.\n- Entering the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state resets the Cooldown of <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Crimson Gleam</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.",
+  "Skill_1006202_SkillResume": "Deal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- Block an incoming attack.\n- Entering the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state resets the Cooldown of <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color>.",
   "Skill_1006203_SkillDescribe": "While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> becomes available. Casting Resonance Liberation deals <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> to targets within range.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> grants Suoming <color=Highlight>Unison</color> for {0}s, triggered only once every {1}s.\nCan be cast in mid-air close to the ground.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Blight Rain, Miasmic Thunder</color></size>\nWhile casting <color=Highlight>Outro Skill</color>, if Suoming has <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, when the active Resonator deals damage, a <color=Highlight>Thunder Crest</color> is summoned as a Coordinated Attack on the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- Within {2}s after this damage is dealt, a <color=Highlight>Thunder Crest</color> can be summoned each second. This effect is triggered once per second. The damage dealt by <color=Highlight>Thunder Crest</color> does not trigger this effect.\n- Only 1 <color=Highlight>Thunder Crest</color> can be summoned per second, up to {3} in total.\n- This effect lasts {4}s, or until the number of summoned <color=Highlight>Thunder Crest</color> reaches the limit.",
   "Skill_1006203_SkillName": "Umbral Canopy: Miasma Lock",
   "Skill_1006203_SkillResume": "While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> becomes available and deals <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nCan be cast in mid-air close to the ground.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> grants Suoming <color=Highlight>Unison</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Blight Rain, Miasmic Thunder</color></size>\nWhile casting <color=Highlight>Outro Skill</color>, if Suoming has <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, when the active Resonator deals damage, a <color=Highlight>Thunder Crest</color> is summoned as a Coordinated Attack on the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.",
   "Skill_1006204_SkillDescribe": "Casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Furled Canopy: Flash Rift</color>, <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Thunder Rending</color>, <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Furled Canopy: Sealed Delusion (Unison)</color>, or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder (Unison)</color> grants {0} Electro DMG Bonus for {1}s. Switching to another Resonator ends this effect early.\n- When Suoming casts <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Furled Canopy: Sealed Delusion (Unison)</color> or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder (Unison)</color>, she additionally gains {2} points of Concerto Energy, triggered only once every {3}s.",
   "Skill_1006204_SkillName": "Rain-Soaked Covenant",
   "Skill_1006204_SkillResume": "Casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Furled Canopy: Flash Rift</color>, <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Thunder Rending</color>, <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Furled Canopy: Sealed Delusion (Unison)</color>, or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder (Unison)</color> grants Electro DMG Bonus.\n- When Suoming casts <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Furled Canopy: Sealed Delusion (Unison)</color> or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder (Unison)</color>, she additionally gains Concerto Energy.",
-  "Skill_1006205_SkillDescribe": "When Suoming has <color=Highlight>Unison</color> and is switched out, she gains the <color=Highlight>Aligned Seals</color> effect for {0}s.\nWhile this effect is active, within {1}s after Suoming casts <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> or <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Umbral Canopy: Engraved Heart</color>, Suoming's <color=Highlight>Outro Skill</color> grants the incoming Resonator {2} Electro DMG Bonus, plus an additional {3} for each stack of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color> they have, up to {4}. This effect lasts for {5}s or until the Resonator is switched out.\n\nWhen Suoming has <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Furled Canopy: Rift Cleaver</color> removes <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, consumes {6} points of Concerto Energy, and clears all <color=Highlight><te href=131201>Delusion</te></color>, granting the <color=Highlight>Seal Master</color> effect: the DMG Multipliers of <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color> and <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder</color> are increased by {7}, each stage of the skills restores {8} points of Concerto Energy on hit, and Suoming's Crit. DMG is increased by {9}. This effect lasts for {10}s or until the Resonator is switched out.\n- Gaining <color=Highlight>Unison</color> ends this effect early.\n- Gaining the <color=Highlight>Aligned Seals</color> effect ends this effect early.\n- The <color=Highlight>Seal Master</color> effect cannot be gained while the <color=Highlight>Aligned Seals</color> effect is active.\n- While the <color=Highlight>Seal Master</color> effect is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 4</color> to chain into <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 2</color>.",
+  "Skill_1006205_SkillDescribe": "When Suoming has <color=Highlight>Unison</color> and is switched out, she gains the <color=Highlight>Aligned Seals</color> effect for {0}s.\nWhile <color=Highlight><te href=131203>Aligned Seals</te></color> is active, within {1}s after Suoming casts <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> or <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Umbral Canopy: Engraved Heart</color>, Suoming's <color=Highlight>Outro Skill</color> grants the incoming Resonator {2} Electro DMG Bonus, plus an additional {3} for each stack of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color> they have, up to {4}. This effect lasts for {5}s or until the Resonator is switched out.\n\nWhen Suoming has <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Furled Canopy: Rift Cleaver</color> removes <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, consumes {6} points of Concerto Energy, and clears all <color=Highlight><te href=131201>Delusion</te></color>, granting the <color=Highlight><te href=131204>Seal Master</te></color> effect: the DMG Multipliers of <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color> and <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder</color> are increased by {7}, each stage of the skills restores {8} points of Concerto Energy on hit, and Suoming's Crit. DMG is increased by {9}. This effect lasts for {10}s or until the Resonator is switched out.\n- Gaining <color=Highlight>Unison</color> ends this effect early.\n- Gaining the <color=Highlight>Aligned Seals</color> effect ends this effect early.\n- The <color=Highlight><te href=131204>Seal Master</te></color> effect cannot be gained while the <color=Highlight><te href=131203>Aligned Seals</te></color> effect is active.\n- While the <color=Highlight><te href=131204>Seal Master</te></color> effect is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 4</color> to chain into <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 2</color>.",
   "Skill_1006205_SkillName": "Sunken Seal, Forged Lock",
-  "Skill_1006205_SkillResume": "When Suoming has <color=Highlight>Unison</color> and is switched out, she gains the <color=Highlight>Aligned Seals</color> effect.\nWhile this effect is active, within a certain time after Suoming casts <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> or <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Umbral Canopy: Engraved Heart</color>, the incoming Resonator gains Electro DMG Bonus.\n\nWhen Suoming has <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Furled Canopy: Rift Cleaver</color> removes <color=Highlight>Unison</color> and grants the <color=Highlight>Seal Master</color> effect: increases the DMG Multipliers of <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color> and <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder</color>, makes each stage of the skills restore extra concerto Energy on hit, and increases Suoming's Crit. DMG.\n- While the <color=Highlight>Seal Master</color> effect is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 4</color> to chain into <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 2</color>.",
+  "Skill_1006205_SkillResume": "When Suoming has <color=Highlight>Unison</color> and is switched out, she gains the <color=Highlight>Aligned Seals</color> effect.\nWhile <color=Highlight>Aligned Seals</color> is active, within a certain time after Suoming casts <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> or <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Umbral Canopy: Engraved Heart</color>, Suoming's <color=Highlight>Outro Skill</color> grants the incoming Resonator gains Electro DMG Bonus.\n\nWhen Suoming has <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Furled Canopy: Rift Cleaver</color> removes <color=Highlight>Unison</color> and grants the <color=Highlight>Seal Master</color> effect: increases the DMG Multipliers of <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color> and <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder</color>, makes each stage of the skills restore extra concerto Energy on hit, and increases Suoming's Crit. DMG.\n- While the <color=Highlight>Seal Master</color> effect is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 4</color> to chain into <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 2</color>.",
   "Skill_1006206_SkillDescribe": "Attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Basic Attack DMG</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> state, casting this skill sends Suoming into the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state and clears all <color=Highlight><te href=131201>Delusion</te></color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Thunder Rending</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> state, triggering Unison Response replaces <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> with <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Furled Canopy: Sealed Delusion (Unison)</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, triggering Unison Response replaces <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> with <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder (Unison)</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Thunder Rending</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Basic Attack DMG</color>.\n- {Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to chain into <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 2</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Furled Canopy: Sealed Delusion (Unison)</color></size>\nAttack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Basic Attack DMG</color>.\n- Casting this skill sends Suoming into the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state and clears all <color=Highlight><te href=131201>Delusion</te></color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder (Unison)</color></size>\nAttack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Basic Attack DMG</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder (Unison)</color> to chain into <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 2</color>.",
